"Water is the element of change\nIt reshapes to always fit in\nBut ice do exists\nWhat about the states lying in wide range?\n\nLiquid water flows\nIt releases the energy inside\nWherever it goes, it always fits in\nIt's soothing and wanted, not aside\n\nSteam is vigorous\nIt contains immense energy\nReleases it where ever it goes\nAnd causes destruction and is feared\n\nIce is different\nIt's stiff but can be broken\nIt does not releases too much energy\nJust melts the inner token\n\nIce is neither soothing\nNot it acts vigorous\nIt's not always wanted\nUnless it's some tensed summer\n\nThe three states of water\nGet the name of water indeed\nSteam has its own identity\nAnd is feared and lives in free\n\nIce gets the name of water\nAnd is treated like steam antonym\nThey say it's solid water\nBut it wants being wanted and understanding"